Package: CFDE.HelpR
Title: Common Fund Data Ecosystem - GitHub HelpR
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person('David', 'Mayer', email = 'DBMI-SET@cuanschutz.edu', role = c('cre', 'aut'), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6056-9771"))
    )
Description: This package allows users to efficiently add Common Fund Data 
    Ecosystem (CFDE) Core Project Numbers as topics to GitHub repositories within 
    this ecosystem. By tagging repositories, you can share additional information 
    about your Common Fund project, aiding the NIH in gaining a comprehensive 
    understanding of your work.
